    "updated_at": "2026-01-20T19:36:59Z",
    "body": "DualShock4's 0xA2 is a feature report, it should be in `featureReports` (the screenshot shows `outputReports`) and you should use sendFeatureReport instead of sendReport.\n\nhttps://wicg.github.io/webhid/#sendfeaturereport-method\n\nIt's interesting that it works in node-hid, are you using `write` or `sendFeatureReport`? Can you share the relevant code?\n\nhttps://github.com/node-hid/node-hid?tab=readme-ov-file#writing-to-a-device-1\n\nIt looks like 0xA2 is \"enable DFU mode\".\n\nhttps://blog.the.al/2023/01/03/ds4-reverse-engineering-part-3.html",
    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
    "pin": null,
