    "updated_at": "2026-01-22T11:46:02Z",
    "body": " Hi @nondebug thanks for you answer! I readed here https://www.psdevwiki.com/ps4/DS4-BT#HID_OUTPUT_reports that 0xA2 it must be send as an output report with payload like LED color, sound, rumble, etc. However I didn't see either the 0xA2 featureReport anounce it.\n\n> It's interesting that it works in node-hid, are you using write or sendFeatureReport? Can you share the relevant code?\nI'm using write to send though node-hid as output and it works perfectly. I didn't test it with send report.\n\nWell the code I'm using I picked up from this repo: https://github.com/Pecacheu/dualshock. I'm just trying to fix the part where you can send audio to the controller by sending sbc data",
