    "updated_at": "2026-01-23T14:44:12Z",
    "body": "So are you saying that I must start the payload with 0x11, do de CRC checksum with that byte as first byte and send to the output report 17 (0x11)?\n\nBecause in node-hid i had to add the 0xA2 byte to payload to the the checksoum and then I had to remove it from the begining. This is from Pecacheu repository:\n\n<img width=\"771\" height=\"644\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e66da92b-60ef-47ac-b2a0-e0f46f4f81e7\" />\n\nI'm gonna try the output 0x11 and see what can I get, thanks!",
